1. Connect the 0.96 OLED display to the Arduino Nano as follows:
	* VCC to 5V
	* GND to GND
	* SCL to SCL (pin 21 on Arduino Nano)
	* SDA to SDA (pin 20 on Arduino Nano)
2. Connect the external RTC module to the Arduino Nano as follows:
	* VCC to 5V
	* GND to GND
	* SCL to SCL (pin 21 on Arduino Nano)
	* SDA to SDA (pin 20 on Arduino Nano)
3. Connect the LEDs to the Arduino Nano as follows:
	* Connect each LED to a digital pin (e.g., D2, D3, D4, etc.)
	* Connect a resistor in series with each LED to limit the current
4. Connect the power supply to the Arduino and RTC modules

